<< /A 37 0 R /Alt (Flowchart illustrating patient selection for a study on T2DM and STEMI, showing identification, screening with 124 and 52 exclusions, eligibility, and inclusion into HF and non-HF groups for analysis of clinical variables.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
16 0 obj
<< /A 38 0 R /Alt (Figure panel with five medical statistics plots: Panel A shows an ROC curve for a logistic regression model predicting heart failure, area under the curve 0.881. Panel B is a calibration plot comparing predicted and observed heart failure probabilities, showing close alignment to ideal calibration. Panel C features a decision curve analysis indicating net benefit of the model across threshold probabilities versus treating all or none. Panel D presents a forest plot of multivariable logistic regression results, visualizing odds ratios for variables like prior myocardial infarction and age groups. Panel E compares predicted heart failure probabilities by age using three modeling approaches, showing differing risk estimates by age group.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 32 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
